<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/38/msa@/~sched_1> <https://schema.org/text> "dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) seksyen I dengan yang berikut: \"(2) In assessing the market value— (a) the effect of any express or implied condilion of title restricting the use to which the scheduled land may be put; and (b) the effect of any prohibition, restriction or requirement imposed by Act168 or under the Antiquities Act 1976 in relation to any ancient monument or historicai site within the meaning of that Act on the scheduled land, shall be taken into account.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/38/msa@> .
